  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 400F (200C).",
    "In a blender or food processor, puree the onion, ginger, garlic, and smoked paprika until you get a smooth paste.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a pan over medium heat and sauté the pureed mixture for 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add the mitsuba to the pan and cook until it's wilted, then stir in the cottage cheese and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with chopped cilantro and a drizzle of lemon juice.",
    "Cover the dish with aluminum foil and bake for 20-25 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 5-10 minutes, or until the top is golden brown and the cheese is melted.",
    "Serve the azifa hot with injera on the side."
  ],
